"""v52: Numerology, the association engine. Every game since 2024 carries its date, weekday, kickoff, closing spread and total,
stadium (name, city, state), roof, referee, starting QBs, head coaches and coordinators, rest days. The engine decodes every
entity in every cipher, reads every number the game carries, and tests every (entity, number, cipher) association on every
graded game for three outcomes (the matched side wins / covers; the game goes over) — then ranks them, scores the chosen
game's decode sheet with each association's own record, folds the matches into a lean per side, and walks that lean forward
season by season so it is graded out of sample. Rerunnable (guarded)."""
